{"4051060": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Shattered Delirium", "steam_appid": 4051060, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>WARNING: This game contains flashing lights and may trigger seizures for people with photosensitive epilepsy. Player discretion is advised.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shattered Delirium is a first-person perspective psychological horror game. Explore a dark, atmospheric world that combines realistic visuals with unsettling audio. Interact with items, solve puzzles and riddles, discover collectibles, and learn the truth of the world of Shattered Delirium!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up and find yourself alone in a prison cell surrounded by dark mysteries. You'll traverse the world of Shattered Delirium through rooms and corridors thought to be long abandoned. Visions and voices will make you question reality. Tattered notes left behind reveal the truth of your existence. Puzzles will test your mind amidst the chaos around you. Discover what lies beyond your fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game contains achievements and multiple endings!</i></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>WARNING: This game contains flashing lights and may trigger seizures for people with photosensitive epilepsy. Player discretion is advised.</i> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Shattered Delirium is a first-person perspective psychological horror game. Explore a dark, atmospheric world that combines realistic visuals with unsettling audio. Interact with items, solve puzzles and riddles, discover collectibles, and learn the truth of the world of Shattered Delirium!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You wake up and find yourself alone in a prison cell surrounded by dark mysteries. You'll traverse the world of Shattered Delirium through rooms and corridors thought to be long abandoned. Visions and voices will make you question reality. Tattered notes left behind reveal the truth of your existence. Puzzles will test your mind amidst the chaos around you. Discover what lies beyond your fears.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>This game contains achievements and multiple endings!</i></p>", "short_description": "Shattered Delirium is a first-person perspective psychological horror game. Explore a dark, atmospheric world that combines realistic visuals with unsettling audio. Interact with items, solve puzzles and riddles, discover collectibles, and learn the truth of the world of Shattered Delirium!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051060/087745e0ed28be379a3ee657d8caa4290d7a635c/header.jpg?t=1761154685", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051060/5b27f80236f99003e379161497eda0408e9e04df/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761154685", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4051060/5b27f80236f99003e379161497eda0408e9e04df/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761154685", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel i7-6900K<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1080Ti<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 3 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Jeremy Bahn"], "publishers": ["Jeremy Bahn"], "price_overview": {"currency": "USD", "initial": 199, "final": 199, "discount_percent": 0, "initial_formatted": "", "final_formatted": "$1.99"}, "packages": [1420830], "package_groups": [{"name": "default", "title": "Buy Shattered Deliri